{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "0c28cb4f-6fd4-4db0-9f31-98db7f2cb5a8",
    "name": "Gym Sales Automation OS - n8n Webhook Test Suite",
    "description": "Professional Postman collection for testing Gym Sales Automation OS.\n\nUse this collection to test:\n- Cloudflare Worker router endpoints\n- Direct n8n webhook endpoints\n- Lead intake happy/failure paths\n- Workflow 02 booking route webhooks\n- Workflow 03 mock Resamania lifecycle events\n- Workflow 03 review request route\n\nImportant:\n- Workflow 02 Route C - Daily Trial Reminder is a scheduled route, not an HTTP webhook. Run it manually inside n8n or wait for its Schedule Trigger. It is not represented as a direct HTTP request unless you add a Webhook trigger to that route.\n- Import `postman/gym-sales-automation-os.postman_environment.json` and select it before running requests.\n- For n8n direct webhook tests, set `n8n_webhook_prefix` to `webhook-test` while using Listen for test event, or `webhook` for active production workflows.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "const now = new Date();",
          "const tomorrowStart = new Date(now);",
          "tomorrowStart.setDate(now.getDate() + 1);",
          "tomorrowStart.setHours(18, 30, 0, 0);",
          "const tomorrowEnd = new Date(tomorrowStart);",
          "tomorrowEnd.setMinutes(tomorrowStart.getMinutes() + 45);",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('trial_start_iso', tomorrowStart.toISOString());",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('trial_end_iso', tomorrowEnd.toISOString());",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('request_timestamp', now.toISOString());"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
